title: "Register-aware computational prioritization of EBV--self peptide pairs across HLA class II contexts"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
abstract: "Frozen computational inputs, source code, manuscript files, and V18 sensitivity analyses supporting a register-aware EBV--self peptide prioritization workflow. This archive supports replay from frozen intermediate outputs; it does not establish peptide-HLA affinity, natural presentation, T-cell recognition, cross-reactivity, molecular mimicry, or an MS mechanism."
